---
description: Frontend code conventions for this Nuxt + Three.js portfolio
globs: app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Code conventions for this project are defined in @AGENTS.md.

Follow them for every `.vue`, `.ts` and `.css` file under `app/`: build Lab scenes
through `useLabScene`, always tear a scene down in `onUnmounted` (cancel the tick,
dispose geometries/materials/textures/renderer, clear timers and listeners), size
the canvas from its container rather than the window, keep experiment pages thin by
moving heavy logic into `composables/lab/`, register every new experiment in
`app/data/lab.ts`, give each page its head via `usePageSeo` (`useLabSeo` for Lab
experiments), use `<script setup lang="ts">` and avoid `any`, reuse the `.btn` /
`.card` Tailwind component classes instead of new raw hex values, reserve
`handle*` names for event handlers, and delete dead or commented-out code.
